1
00:00:20,291 --> 00:00:22,589
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:38,113 --> 00:00:43,530
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:46,913
=Episode 2=

4
00:00:51,776 --> 00:00:55,276
(Lu Baby)

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,200
Why aren't you answering your phone?

6
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,251
Lin Lulu is our golden goose.

7
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,719
A woman like Lin Lulu

8
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:06,640
has always had everything handed to her.

9
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,719
And far too easily.

10
00:01:08,439 --> 00:01:10,799
I need her to feel like she can have me,

11
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:12,640
but never feel completely secure
about keeping me.

12
00:01:13,359 --> 00:01:15,040
Only then can we totally control her

13
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:16,799
and take back everything
the Lin family owns.

14
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,640
It's hundreds of billions.

15
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,640
That's a fortune.

16
00:01:25,959 --> 00:01:27,079
Then...

17
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:29,719
the prenuptial agreement
between you and her...

18
00:01:30,239 --> 00:01:32,040
It is locked away in Su Qinglan's safe.

19
00:01:33,719 --> 00:01:34,799
You brought it, right?

20
00:01:35,015 --> 00:01:36,869
(The number you dialed
is temporarily...)

21
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:42,239
What are you waiting for? Keep going.

22
00:01:42,411 --> 00:01:44,480
(Lin Lulu is completely
under Zhang Haotian's control.)

23
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,959
(She has no sense of security.)

24
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:47,879
(This is her biggest weakness.)

25
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,920
I told you to keep going.

26
00:01:54,959 --> 00:01:56,400
Don't you understand what I'm saying?

27
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,719
Zhao Ke, what are you doing?

28
00:02:02,719 --> 00:02:03,519
Miss Lin,

29
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:05,280
if a man doesn't reply to your messages,

30
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,280
stop texting him over and over.

31
00:02:06,599 --> 00:02:07,519
Listen to me.

32
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,960
Someone as beautiful as you

33
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,902
could use this time

34
00:02:09,903 --> 00:02:11,159
for a body treatment from me.

35
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:14,599
I guarantee your skin will become
even softer and smoother.

36
00:02:14,919 --> 00:02:17,319
He won't be able to resist you.

37
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,599
What are you talking about?

38
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:20,759
Do you really think I'll believe that?

39
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,159
It smells nice too.

40
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,960
But since you put it that way,

41
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,800
I'll give it a try.

42
00:02:33,719 --> 00:02:37,199
If your method actually works,

43
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:41,680
you'll be my chief beauty specialist
for my wedding.

44
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,439
(The bait has been taken.)

45
00:02:43,439 --> 00:02:45,800
(The game is about to begin.)

46
00:02:47,879 --> 00:02:48,520
I have it.

47
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,680
The anti-rejection medication
after the kidney transplant,

48
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,479
I added something to it.

49
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,919
Within three months,

50
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,400
Su Qinglan will die
from a rejection reaction.

51
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:00,800
By the way,

52
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:02,800
I should remind you of one thing.

53
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,800
When it comes to Lin Lulu,
you need to...

54
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:06,520
I know what I'm doing.

55
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,120
Good.

56
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,240
Goodbye.

57
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,840
This way, Miss Lin.

58
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:39,719
Thank you for coming, Miss Lin.

59
00:03:40,491 --> 00:03:44,706
(Bestyou Medical Beauty)

60
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,360
So you finally decided to show up.

61
00:03:48,039 --> 00:03:48,639
Baby.

62
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:49,919
I'm not your baby.

63
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:51,319
Your work is your real baby.

64
00:03:51,639 --> 00:03:53,080
Why don't you just marry your work?

65
00:03:54,319 --> 00:03:55,159
Baby.

66
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,039
I'm really sorry.

67
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:58,719
You ignored my calls for so long

68
00:03:58,719 --> 00:03:59,719
and didn't even reply to my messages.

69
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:00,879
I won't forgive you.

70
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:04,560
Haotian.

71
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:06,919
What happened to your hand?

72
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,240
I'm fine.

73
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,240
Tell me.

74
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,555
Or I'll really be mad.

75
00:04:11,580 --> 00:04:13,080
(Here he goes again.)

76
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:16,240
(Making his lies sound more convincing
than the truth.)

77
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:19,040
Didn't I have someone
make you a wedding dress?

78
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:22,319
Actually, I also asked someone
in South Africa

79
00:04:22,319 --> 00:04:23,560
to buy ten gemstones.

80
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:26,160
I wanted to sew them
onto the dress myself.

81
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:27,240
So...

82
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:28,519
So,

83
00:04:28,759 --> 00:04:31,160
you weren't actually working.
You were...

84
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,319
I wanted to surprise you.

85
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,439
(Custom wedding dress?)

86
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,279
I misunderstood you.

87
00:04:35,279 --> 00:04:37,040
(A surprise prepared by hand?)

88
00:04:37,530 --> 00:04:39,909
(Just another trick he uses
to fool women.)

89
00:04:40,399 --> 00:04:42,360
(Cheap and disgusting.)

90
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:43,560
Careful.

91
00:04:43,872 --> 00:04:44,713
(Zhang Haotian,)

92
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,879
(see you at the wedding.)

93
00:04:51,663 --> 00:04:55,698
(Wedding Venue)

94
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:58,360
For an outfit in your style,

95
00:04:58,360 --> 00:05:00,800
I would suggest choosing

96
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,079
slightly longer earrings next time.

97
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,759
(Jiang Lai?)

98
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:19,519
(Zhang Haotian, I'm here
to send you to hell.)

99
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,519
(It's really her.)

100
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:23,839
(She... she's alive.)

101
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:27,199
Hello, Mr. Zhang.

102
00:05:30,519 --> 00:05:31,480
Congratulations.

103
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,240
I'll go check on the bride's makeup.

104
00:06:02,857 --> 00:06:04,199
(Jiang Lai was cremated.)

105
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:06,279
(She couldn't have come back
from the dead.)

106
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,574
(Then who is this person?)

107
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:13,519
Miss Lin, your husband is here.

108
00:06:24,519 --> 00:06:25,920
Why are you staring at me like that?

109
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:30,240
My bride is so beautiful.

110
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,639
That's only because

111
00:06:33,079 --> 00:06:35,120
the wedding dress you prepared for me
is beautiful.

112
00:06:35,137 --> 00:06:35,968
Yeah.

113
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,160
My baby is already beautiful.

114
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,560
I just made her even more perfect.

115
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,000
- How is it?
- (Zhang Haotian.)

116
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,759
(You gave her the same wedding dress?)

117
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:47,920
Jiang Lai.

118
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:50,560
Will you marry me?

119
00:07:08,064 --> 00:07:10,738
♪Whatever happens♪

120
00:07:11,667 --> 00:07:13,541
♪God knows I try♪

121
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:15,879
Baby, I even had a custom
wedding dress made for you.

122
00:07:16,319 --> 00:07:17,480
You want to see it, don't you?

123
00:07:18,839 --> 00:07:19,439
You want to see it?

124
00:07:19,544 --> 00:07:20,304
I do.

125
00:07:21,771 --> 00:07:23,931
♪Hand on the weapon♪

126
00:07:25,284 --> 00:07:27,867
♪Devil inside♪

127
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:29,920
My bride looks stunning.

128
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:32,120
It's the dress that looks beautiful.

129
00:07:32,439 --> 00:07:33,279
No.

130
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,480
My baby is always beautiful.

131
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:36,680
The dress

132
00:07:37,439 --> 00:07:39,319
just made her even more perfect.

133
00:07:47,555 --> 00:07:50,957
♪Ain't no fire, fire♪

134
00:07:51,316 --> 00:07:54,004
♪Can burn you like the cold♪

135
00:07:54,365 --> 00:07:57,810
♪Ain't no fire, fire♪

136
00:07:58,184 --> 00:08:00,851
♪Can hurt me like you♪

137
00:08:02,828 --> 00:08:05,330
♪So I let it burn♪

138
00:08:05,355 --> 00:08:09,258
(Mr. Zhang and Ms. Lin
Welcome to our wedding.)

139
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,920
The groom may now kiss the bride.

140
00:08:23,378 --> 00:08:26,704
♪Ain't no fire, fire♪

141
00:08:27,219 --> 00:08:29,893
♪Can burn you like the cold♪

142
00:08:30,366 --> 00:08:33,804
♪Ain't no fire, fire♪

143
00:08:34,313 --> 00:08:37,000
♪Can hurt me like you♪

144
00:08:40,745 --> 00:08:45,675
♪So I let it burn♪

145
00:08:48,363 --> 00:08:53,328
♪Burn♪

146
00:08:54,936 --> 00:08:59,186
♪Burn♪

147
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:04,000
(Even if she isn't Jiang Lai,)

148
00:09:04,399 --> 00:09:06,360
(she can't ruin my plans.)

149
00:09:14,879 --> 00:09:16,080
Mr. Zhang,

150
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,559
what did I do to offend you?

151
00:09:22,925 --> 00:09:24,925
(Inner Demon)

152
00:09:25,681 --> 00:09:29,779
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

153
00:09:30,587 --> 00:09:33,399
♪I should forget you♪

154
00:09:33,868 --> 00:09:38,945
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

155
00:09:38,969 --> 00:09:40,809
♪To carry on♪

156
00:09:41,065 --> 00:09:45,922
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

157
00:09:46,288 --> 00:09:48,176
♪You no longer have the strength♪

158
00:09:50,475 --> 00:09:53,356
♪You want me to go there for you♪

159
00:09:54,924 --> 00:10:00,362
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

160
00:10:00,956 --> 00:10:04,095
♪Your freedom♪

161
00:10:04,795 --> 00:10:09,226
♪Has become my cage♪

162
00:10:10,154 --> 00:10:15,945
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

163
00:10:17,296 --> 00:10:23,146
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

164
00:10:23,609 --> 00:10:29,556
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

165
00:10:29,836 --> 00:10:33,086
♪You told me♪

166
00:10:33,483 --> 00:10:37,989
♪I would shine like a star♪

167
00:10:38,833 --> 00:10:42,166
♪But you forgot♪

168
00:10:42,190 --> 00:10:47,030
♪To teach me how to live without you♪

169
00:10:47,249 --> 00:10:53,074
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

170
00:10:54,595 --> 00:10:58,379
♪So hazy and blurred♪
